                                "sense_id": "4d34e399-35ae-3ad0-a6fe-ee58746d912d",
                                "text": "If all sloughings were successfully recorded, which is not certain since rattle segments were not color-coded during this study, the interval between events averaged 246.1 days (1.5 sloughings per snake per year)."
